API 3: Save Post
Endpoint
POST /api/company/posts/{postId}/save

Logic:

INSERT INTO COMPANY_POST_SAVE(userId, companyPostId)

If already saved:

return success
(do not insert duplicate)
API 4: Unsave Post
Endpoint
DELETE /api/company/posts/{postId}/save

Logic:

DELETE FROM COMPANY_POST_SAVE
WHERE userId = @userId
AND companyPostId = @postId
